# Switch: an FS 180 lands rolling backward (fakie); popped off the nose rolling backward (Q held as K is
# let go) is Switch: J + left is a Switch Kickflip, worth tricks.stance.switch (1.25) of its points. Off
# the tail it would be a Fakie Kickflip (lab-halfcab).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold left 92..130
hold ollie 250..272
hold nose 266..272
tap flip+left 276
run 520
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 180} within 160..240
expect event pop{fakie=true,nose=true} within 273..273
expect event comboLanded{name=Switch Kickflip,points=125} within 330..470
expect no event bail
